You can currently check if a user is in TPV using the following workaround:

```

if (VRCCameraSettings.ScreenCamera.CameraMode != VRCCameraMode.Screen && VRCCameraSettings.ScreenCamera.CameraMode != VRCCameraMode.FocusView)

{

          //User is in TPV             

}

```

An event would be better, because constantly checking this is not performant-
